    "detailed_description": "Can you reach the top?<br><br>Shadow Jump is a punishing platformer where a single mistake can be devastating. However through a bit of creativity and a lot of patience, success is only a matter of time...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Charge rockets by holding left click, the resulting explosion will propel your character in the opposite direction. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Rockets can be charged midair to chain jumps together, allowing for creative routes up each level. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But be careful... not all platforms are alike <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><br>Explore six ambient levels as you ascend, each with a unique theme and unique challenges. Mastery of each level is key, as certain mistakes may force you to repeat them. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "Can you reach the top?<br><br>Shadow Jump is a punishing platformer where a single mistake can be devastating. However through a bit of creativity and a lot of patience, success is only a matter of time...<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2>Charge rockets by holding left click, the resulting explosion will propel your character in the opposite direction. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/6ce88269129dcbea7e8711e8a03f39e3.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Rockets can be charged midair to chain jumps together, allowing for creative routes up each level. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/50a688fabbf5f52d3d32d15e6b461428.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>But be careful... not all platforms are alike <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/b7e53743eda8c87ff0f02f853a5a506a.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Levels</h2><br>Explore six ambient levels as you ascend, each with a unique theme and unique challenges. Mastery of each level is key, as certain mistakes may force you to repeat them. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.poster.avif?t=1665798922\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.webm?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2014330/extras/8fa47fbf407357a4a248d7eb383a9277.mp4?t=1665798922\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "short_description": "Shadow Jump is a challenging fantasy platformer game focused around difficulty and freedom of movement. There are no set routes or strategies; players will be able to carve their own route to the top. Success will require determination, precision and a lot of patience...",
